  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chisankho Chopambana cha Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine ndikunena zoona mwa Khristu. Sindikunama ndipo chikumbumtima changa kudzera mwa Mzimu Woyera chikundichitira umboni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndili ndi chisoni chachikulu ndipo ndikumva kupwetekeka kosalekeza mu mtima mwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti ndikanafuna ine mwini nditatembereredwa ndi kuchotsedwa mwa Khristu chifukwa cha abale anga, amene ndi a mtundu wanga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anthu Aisraeli. Iwo anasankhidwa kukhala ana. Mulungu anawapatsa ulemerero, anachita nawo mapangano, kuwapatsa Malamulo, Nyumba yopembedzeramo ndi malonjezano ake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ndi makolo athu. Kuchokera kwa iwo mʼthupi ndi kumene kunachokera makolo a Khristu Yesu amene ndi Mulungu wolamulira zinthu zonse, alemekezeke mpaka muyaya! Ameni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikuti mawu a Mulungu analephera. Pakuti si onse obadwa mwa Israeli amene ndi Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapena kuti ana ake chifukwa anachokera mwa Abrahamu. Koma zidzukulu zako zidzachokera mwa Isake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutanthauza kuti, si ana obadwa mʼthupi amene ndi ana a Mulungu koma ndi ana a lonjezano amene amatengedwa kukhala zidzukulu za Abrahamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti Mulungu analonjeza ponena kuti, \"Pa nthawi yake ngati yomwe ino chaka chamawa ndidzabweranso, ndipo Sara adzakhala ndi mwana wamwamuna.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo si pokhapo ayi. Ana awiri a Rebeka aja abambo awo anali mmodzi, kholo lathu Isake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komabe, ana amapasawa asanabadwe kapena asanachite chilichonse chabwino kapena choyipa, nʼcholinga choti chifuniro cha Mulungu chosankhiratu munthu aliyense chipitirire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "osati chifukwa cha ntchito za munthu koma chifuniro cha Iye mwini, anawuza Rebeka kuti, \"Wamkulu adzatumikira wamʼngʼono.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monga momwe kwalembedwa kuti, \"Ine ndinakonda Yakobo, koma ndinamuda Esau.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanga tsono tidzanena chiyani? Kodi Mulungu ndi osalungama? Ayi, ndi pangʼono pomwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti Mulungu anawuza Mose kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ine ndidzachitira chifundo amene ndikufuna kumuchitira chifundo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo ndidzakomera mtima amene ndikufuna kumukomera mtima.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼchifukwa chake, izi sizitengera zokhumba za munthu kapena kuyesetsa koma chifundo cha Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malemba akuti Mulungu anamuwuza Farao kuti, \"Ine ndakuyika kukhala mfumu ndi cholinga choti ndionetse mphamvu zanga, kuti mwa iwe dzina langa litchuke pa dziko lonse lapansi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Choncho Mulungu amachitira chifundo munthu amene akufuna kumuchitira chifundo ndipo amawumitsa mtima munthu amene Iye akufuna kumuwumitsa mtima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsono mmodzi wa inu nʼkundifunsa kuti, \"Nanga nʼchifukwa chiyani Mulungu amatipeza olakwa? Nanga ndani amene amakana chifuniro chake?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma ndiwe yani, munthu wamba, woti nʼkutsutsana ndi Mulungu? \"Kodi chimene chinawumbidwa nʼkufunsa amene anachiwumba kuti, 'Kodi unandiwumbiranji motere?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodi wowumba alibe ufulu wowumba kuchokera ku dothi lomwelo mbiya yamtengowapatali ndi ina yamtengo wotsika?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma Mulungu, anafuna kuonetsa mkwiyo wake ndi kuti mphamvu yake idziwike. Iye anapirira modekha mtima kwambiri zochita za anthu omwe anawakwiyirawo amene anayeneradi chiwonongeko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye anachita izi kufuna kuonetsa kulemera kwa ulemerero wake ndi kuti udziwike kwa amene analandira chifundo chake. Iye anawakonzeratu kuti alandire ulemerero wake",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngakhale ifenso amene anatiyitana osati kuchokera kwa Ayuda okha komanso kwa a mitundu ina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monga momwe Mulungu akunenera mʼbuku la Hoseya kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Amene sanali anthu anga ndidzawatcha 'anthu anga;'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:25"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo Ine ndidzatcha 'wokondedwa wanga' amene sali wokondedwa wanga,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndipo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Pamalo omwewo pamene ananena kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "'Sindinu anthu anga,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "pomweponso adzawatchula kuti, 'Ana a Mulungu wamoyo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesaya anafuwula za Aisraeli kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ngakhale chiwerengero cha Aisraeli chingakhale ngati mchenga wa ku nyanja,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "otsala okha ndiye adzapulumuke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti Ambuye adzagamula milandu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ya anthu pa dziko lapansi mofulumira ndi kumaliziratu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monga momwe Yesaya ananena malo ena kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Ngati Yehova Wamphamvuzonse",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "akanapanda kutisiyira zidzukulu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ife tikanawonongeka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ngati anthu a ku Sodomu, tikanakhala ngati anthu a ku Gomora.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kusakhulupirira kwa Aisraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodi nanga tidzati chiyani? Tidzati a mitundu ina amene sanafune chilungamo analandira chilungamo chachikhulupiriro",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koma Aisraeli, amene anafuna chilungamo cha lamulo sanachilandire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chifukwa chiyani? Chifukwa iwo sanachifune ndi chikhulupiriro koma ngati mwa ntchito. Iwo anapunthwa pa \"Mwala wopunthwitsa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monga momwe kwalembedwa kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Taonani, Ine ndikuyika mwala mu Ziyoni wopunthwitsa anthu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ROM 9:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "thanthwe limene limagwetsa anthu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ROM 9:33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koma amene akhulupirira Iye sadzachititsidwa manyazi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
